00:00:28.454 --> 00:00:30.091
Hey everyone, my name is Matt Bellassai

00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:31.588
and this is Whine About It,

00:00:31.588 --> 00:00:33.933
a weekly video series where
I get drunk at my desk

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.337
and complain about stuff.

00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:37.996
And on this very special holiday edition,

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:42.930
our topic is "Ways to Win
at Thanksgiving Dinner".

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.437
Because Thanksgiving is
more than just a holiday,

00:00:45.437 --> 00:00:47.596
it is a test of spirit.

00:00:47.596 --> 00:00:50.070
And I'm not about to lose this shit.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.730
So let's drink.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.197
(upbeat music)

00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:59.949
Can't spill on my fancy sweater.

00:00:59.949 --> 00:01:03.786
I paid $40 for this
sweater. Can't ruin it.

00:01:07.231 --> 00:01:08.612
Oh, boy.

00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:12.849
Alright, first. Thanksgiving rule #1.

00:01:12.849 --> 00:01:17.493
If you stop eating after
one plate, you are losing.

00:01:17.493 --> 00:01:19.652
The food on your plate should be one

00:01:19.652 --> 00:01:21.951
mountainous heap of glory,

00:01:21.951 --> 00:01:25.991
and if you stop at one food
mountain, you've given up.

00:01:25.991 --> 00:01:28.614
You think the pilgrims
stopped at one food mountain?

00:01:28.614 --> 00:01:29.914
They didn't.

00:01:29.914 --> 00:01:31.888
The pilgrims didn't stop for anything.

00:01:31.888 --> 00:01:33.351
They probably should have,

00:01:33.351 --> 00:01:35.115
because they killed a bunch of people.

00:01:35.115 --> 00:01:39.190
Second, Thanksgivin' is
not a time for chewing.

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:42.789
Thanksgiving is a time for
dippin' everything in gravy,

00:01:42.789 --> 00:01:44.948
and just sliding it right down there.

00:01:44.948 --> 00:01:47.967
Everyone's always like "Matt,
why don't you slow down?

00:01:47.967 --> 00:01:50.207
We can hear you struggling to breathe."

00:01:50.207 --> 00:01:53.522
This turkey didn't sacrifice
his life for me to slow down.

00:01:53.522 --> 00:01:55.386
This turkey sacrificed his life

00:01:55.386 --> 00:01:57.128
so that I could take his left leg,

00:01:57.128 --> 00:01:59.252
dip it in some sweet mashed potatoes,

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.806
and then shove it right past my tonsils.

00:02:01.806 --> 00:02:05.591
I don't have to take it
slow. Just go right in.

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.843
Next, every time your drunk,

00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:10.257
racist uncle mentions Donald Trump,

00:02:10.257 --> 00:02:12.138
take one big deep breath,

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:14.343
and then scream. Violently.

00:02:14.343 --> 00:02:18.442
Into the soft comfort of
a warm butter potato roll.

00:02:18.442 --> 00:02:20.520
Racist uncles can't ruin your Thanksgiving

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.642
if you're screamin' into
a warm butter potato roll.

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:25.755
Donald Trump can't find you there, either.

00:02:25.755 --> 00:02:28.262
Just scream it out,
that's what I always say.

00:02:28.262 --> 00:02:30.723
Also, every time someone mentions

00:02:30.723 --> 00:02:32.779
that they're having a (bleep) baby,

00:02:32.779 --> 00:02:36.134
or getting married, or
they got a job promotion,

00:02:36.134 --> 00:02:38.421
take a big old shot of gravy.

00:02:38.421 --> 00:02:41.137
'Cause I'd rather my
arteries clog up right now,

00:02:41.137 --> 00:02:42.843
than to listen to a list

00:02:42.843 --> 00:02:46.221
of your shit accomplishments
for a single second.

00:02:46.221 --> 00:02:47.800
Guess what I did this year.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.113
(bleep) nothin'.

00:02:49.113 --> 00:02:50.773
You hear me bragging about it?

00:02:50.773 --> 00:02:52.920
I'm not here to hear about your shit life.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.914
I'm here to eat until I
can't see colors anymore.

00:02:56.914 --> 00:02:58.121
Next!

00:02:58.121 --> 00:03:02.672
Unless a salad is creamy,
buttery, and cheese-based,

00:03:02.672 --> 00:03:06.178
it has no place getting
stuffed in this gullet.

00:03:06.178 --> 00:03:09.312
Givin' someone a salad on Thanksgiving

00:03:09.312 --> 00:03:13.132
is like punchin' a baby,
right in its baby face.

00:03:13.132 --> 00:03:17.056
It may make you feel good, but
there's a time and a place.

00:03:17.056 --> 00:03:18.658
This is Thanksgiving!

00:03:18.658 --> 00:03:22.778
Thanksgiving is a time
for family, and friends,

00:03:22.778 --> 00:03:25.362
and swallowing foods that are made up

00:03:25.362 --> 00:03:28.114
of at least 50% mayonnaise.

00:03:28.114 --> 00:03:31.040
Not for your (bleep)
salad. I'll tell you that.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.673
Also, every time someone asks
if you're dating anybody,

00:03:34.673 --> 00:03:36.959
just meow like a hungry cat.

00:03:36.959 --> 00:03:39.758
They're always like "Matt, how's work?

00:03:39.758 --> 00:03:43.078
How's your apartment?
Are you seeing anybody?"

00:03:43.078 --> 00:03:46.200
I'm always like... (meows)

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.338
Next!

00:03:47.338 --> 00:03:52.075
Do not, under any circumstances,
announce to the internet,

00:03:52.075 --> 00:03:54.432
