00:04:07.225 --> 00:04:09.663
Related to you or otherwise.

00:04:09.663 --> 00:04:10.824
Next.

00:04:10.824 --> 00:04:14.004
Thanksgiving is the only time of the year

00:04:14.004 --> 00:04:17.545
