00:04:17.545 --> 00:04:20.784
Because eating is the only
sport worth sweating for.

00:04:20.784 --> 00:04:24.127
I walk in that feast and
I'm ready to throw down.

00:04:24.127 --> 00:04:25.944
And get wrecked.

00:04:25.944 --> 00:04:30.939
Also remember, anything is a
napkin if you try hard enough.

00:04:30.939 --> 00:04:34.243
Alright? It'll come to
you. When you need it.

00:04:34.243 --> 00:04:36.669
Finally, if anybody stops you from having

00:04:36.669 --> 00:04:38.863
